## Quick Start

### 1. Initialize ShardCoordinator
```java
ShardCoordinator shardCoordinator = new ShardCoordinator();
shardCoordinator.initializeGeographicShards(); // Creates 20 shards
shardCoordinator.startHealthMonitoring();
shardCoordinator.startAutoRebalancing();
```

### 2. Setup PasschainManager
```java
PasschainManager passchainManager = new PasschainManager();
String westAfricaChain = passchainManager.createPasschain(
    "West Africa Retail", 
    PasschainType.GEOGRAPHIC
);
passchainManager.startCheckpointing();
```

### 3. Initialize RelayChainProtocol
```java
CrossShardRelay crossShardRelay = new CrossShardRelay();
RelayChainProtocol relayProtocol = new RelayChainProtocol(crossShardRelay);

// Register relay validators
relayProtocol.registerValidator("validator-1", "publicKey1");
relayProtocol.startTimeoutChecker();
```

### 4. Configure LoadBalancer
```java
LoadBalancer loadBalancer = new LoadBalancer(shardCoordinator);
loadBalancer.initializeShardLoads();
loadBalancer.setStrategy(LoadBalancingStrategy.HYBRID);
loadBalancer.startAutoRebalancing();

// Route transaction
int targetShard = loadBalancer.routeTransaction(fromAddress, toAddress);
```

### 5. Setup RegionalNodeCluster
```java
RegionalNodeCluster nodeCluster = new RegionalNodeCluster();
nodeCluster.registerNode("node-1", "192.168.1.100", "WEST_AFRICA");
nodeCluster.startHealthMonitoring();
```

### 6. Initialize Fair-Rate System
```java
DecentralizedFXMatcher fxMatcher = new DecentralizedFXMatcher();

// Register African exchanges (55% bonus)
fxMatcher.registerExchange(
    "lagos-exchange", 
    "Lagos Stock Exchange",
    SourceType.AFRICAN_EXCHANGE
);

// Register global exchanges (standard weight)
fxMatcher.registerExchange(
    "binance", 
    "Binance",
    SourceType.GLOBAL_EXCHANGE
);

fxMatcher.startRateCalculation();

// Submit rate quotes
fxMatcher.submitQuote("lagos-exchange", "NGN-GHS", 
    new BigDecimal("0.025"), new BigDecimal("1000000"));
```

### 7. Setup Liquidity Pools
```java
LiquidityPoolRegistry poolRegistry = new LiquidityPoolRegistry();

// Create African priority pool
String poolId = poolRegistry.createPool("NGN-TOKEN", "ASU-TOKEN", true);

// Add liquidity
poolRegistry.addLiquidity(poolId, providerAddress, 
    BigInteger.valueOf(1000000), 
    BigInteger.valueOf(50000)
);

// Execute swap
BigInteger asuOut = poolRegistry.swap(poolId, "NGN-TOKEN", 
    BigInteger.valueOf(10000));
```

### 8. Initialize CrossBorderBridge
```java
CrossBorderBridge bridge = new CrossBorderBridge(
    fxMatcher, 
    poolRegistry, 
    relayProtocol
);

bridge.startTimeoutChecker();

// Initiate cross-border settlement
String settlementId = bridge.initiateSettlement(
    "NGN",           // From Nigeria
    "GHS",           // To Ghana
    senderAddress,
    recipientAddress,
    amount,
    "NGN",
    "GHS"
);
```

### 9. Setup Interoperability
```java
InteroperabilityProtocol interop = new InteroperabilityProtocol();

// Register external chains
interop.registerExternalChain(new ExternalChainConfig(
    "ethereum-mainnet",
    "Ethereum Mainnet",
    ChainType.ETHEREUM,
    "https://mainnet.infura.io",
    12 // confirmations
));

// Create bridge
String bridgeId = interop.createBridge("TINC", "ethereum-mainnet");

// Submit cross-chain transaction
String txId = interop.submitCrossChainTransaction(
    "TINC", 
    "ethereum-mainnet", 
    payload
);
