## Security Features

### 1. Geographic Distribution
- Enforced 33% maximum control per region
- Multi-region validator requirements
- Automatic rebalancing to maintain distribution

### 2. Anti-Manipulation
- Z-score outlier detection (3σ threshold)
- Median Absolute Deviation analysis
- Reputation-based source weighting
- Multi-source verification required

### 3. Cryptographic Security
- SHA-256 hashing for message integrity
- Merkle proofs for cross-shard verification
- Multi-signature validation (2/3+ required)
- Proof-of-reserves cryptographic verification

## African Priority Mechanisms

### Fair-Rate Algorithm
```java
// African exchanges get 55% weight bonus
AFRICAN_EXCHANGE_WEIGHT = 1.55  // 1.0 + 0.55 bonus
GLOBAL_EXCHANGE_WEIGHT = 1.0

// Weighted average calculation
fairRate = Σ(rate_i × weight_i) / Σ(weight_i)
```

### Fee Structure
```java
// Intra-African trade: 0.1% fee
INTRA_AFRICAN_FEE = 0.001

// External trade: 0.5% fee  
EXTERNAL_FEE = 0.005

// 5x lower fees for African trade!
```

### Liquidity Pool Bonuses
```java
// African pools get 55% bonus on swaps
if (pool.isAfricanPool()) {
    BigInteger bonus = amountIn * 0.55;
    effectiveAmountIn = amountIn + bonus;
}
```

