## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

**Issue**: Shard overloaded (>90% utilization)
**Solution**: LoadBalancer automatically redistributes load. Monitor rebalancing logs.

**Issue**: Cross-shard messages timing out
**Solution**: Check RelayChainProtocol validator connectivity and network latency.

**Issue**: Fair rate confidence below 80%
**Solution**: Register more exchange sources. Verify oracle data quality.

**Issue**: Regional control exceeds 33%
**Solution**: ShardCoordinator prevents this automatically. Check node registration.

